<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">shadow</ansi>

Tail a target between rooms while remaining hidden. You
automatically follow when they move.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage:</ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">shadow [target]</ansi> - Begin shadowing
  <ansi fg="command">shadow stop</ansi>     - Stop shadowing

You must be hidden to begin. Each room transition checks
whether observers spot you. Your target may also sense
they are being followed.

Requires <ansi fg="skill">skullduggery</ansi> rank 2.

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help sneak</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help skullduggery</ansi>
